1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,080
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,940
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,320
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:28,040
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,520
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:35,080
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,800
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,120
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,960
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:58,040
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:02,120
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:09,040
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,680
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:18,840
=Episode 21=

17
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:28,519
Over there.

18
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:31,120
You guys,

19
00:01:31,599 --> 00:01:32,120
check over there.

20
00:01:32,319 --> 00:01:32,920
Yes.

21
00:01:33,519 --> 00:01:33,959
Move!

22
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,400
Search it.

23
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:42,400
Nothing, Officer Luo.

24
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,120
Nothing here, Officer Luo.

25
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:49,159
Keep searching.

26
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,200
Boss Lin.

27
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,240
The day Boss Hui was killed,

28
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:10,240
Tai was wearing this.

29
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:16,879
It's... it's still warm.

30
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:17,800
After him!

31
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:19,080
Go!

32
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:19,599
Go!

33
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:19,960
Hurry!

34
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:22,400
Hurry! Hurry!

35
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:39,479
Don't follow me anymore.

36
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,280
This is where we part ways.

37
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,400
I'm the one they're after.

38
00:02:43,919 --> 00:02:45,080
This has nothing to do with you.

39
00:02:45,879 --> 00:02:47,000
No one knows who you are.

40
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,159
You'll be safe.

41
00:02:48,919 --> 00:02:49,520
This

42
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:51,240
so-called father of yours

43
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,639
has only ever brought you pain.

44
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,479
Today, the only thing I can give you

45
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,000
is a way out.

46
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:02,759
Remember,

47
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,840
once you leave this life behind,

48
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:06,319
don't ever look back.

49
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,120
Go.

50
00:03:10,159 --> 00:03:10,800
Then...

51
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:12,879
will we ever see each other again?

52
00:03:13,479 --> 00:03:14,520
Forget

53
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,680
everything about your past.

54
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:18,479
Live your life for yourself.

55
00:03:19,639 --> 00:03:20,039
Go.

56
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,560
Go!

57
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:24,800
Get out of here!

58
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,039
Dongshan Tai!

59
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,080
Dongshan Tai!

60
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:32,080
You're surrounded.

61
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,080
Surrender now.

62
00:03:38,319 --> 00:03:38,879
Take him away.

63
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:52,919
Su.

64
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,719
Why did you have to do this?

65
00:03:59,719 --> 00:04:00,080
You...

66
00:04:14,639 --> 00:04:15,280
Officer Luo.

67
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,360
Mind giving us

68
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:17,879
a minute?

69
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,439
Lin.

70
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:24,720
How could you be late

71
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:26,720
when you were protecting
someone's family?

72
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:28,519
And tonight,

73
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,839
when you came to see me off
at the docks,

74
00:04:31,079 --> 00:04:32,439
you were late again.

75
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:34,879
When you become the shot-caller,

76
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:36,920
you'd better break that habit.

77
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:44,199
I have a feeling we'll meet again.

78
00:04:46,079 --> 00:04:46,959
While you're inside,

79
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,839
take care of yourself.

80
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:53,160
You too.

81
00:04:59,160 --> 00:04:59,959
Shen Yanlin.

82
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,680
I'm actually curious

83
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:06,000
what kind of shot-caller you'll be.

84
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:13,360
Then, Officer Luo,

85
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,439
keep your eyes wide open.

86
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:19,079
I'll be watching you.

87
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,235
(Dongcheng Gang Headquarters)

88
00:06:09,236 --> 00:06:12,960
(Honor Through Generations,
Loyalty for Eternity)

89
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:19,520
(Memorial Tablet of the Late
Brother Qian Shihui)

90
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,560
(I want Boss Hui's memorial tablet)

91
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,399
(in Loyalty Hall,)

92
00:06:38,079 --> 00:06:39,560
(where everyone can pay his respects.)

93
00:06:39,640 --> 00:06:41,280
(Memorial Tablet of the Late
Brother Qian Shihui)

94
00:07:06,519 --> 00:07:07,920
Boss!

95
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,240
(Dongcheng Tiger)
(Lin.)

96
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,279
(My brother.)

97
00:07:34,399 --> 00:07:36,040
I asked you two elders here today

98
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:38,199
because there's something
I want to discuss.

99
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,399
You brought Dongshan Tai down

100
00:07:41,759 --> 00:07:42,959
and cleared Hui's name.

101
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:45,000
You deserve the credit.

102
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,079
Just tell us what's on your mind.

103
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:49,000
The stuff we used to smuggle in

104
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:51,360
is everywhere now.

105
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:54,160
Times have changed.

106
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,920
Everything's different now.

107
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,240
What's your point?

108
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,839
The old smuggling routes

109
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,399
don't work anymore.

110
00:08:02,759 --> 00:08:03,759
If we stop moving product,

111
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:06,079
how are we supposed to make a living?

112
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,360
We've been using those routes

113
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,199
for years.

114
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,319
You want us to just throw them away?

115
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:13,680
I'm not saying we throw them away.

116
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,160
I'm saying we take a different path.

117
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,519
My path.

118
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:22,800
Lin.

119
00:08:24,439 --> 00:08:25,600
What exactly are you getting at?

120
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,839
He's saying, have some tea.

121
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,600
What I'm saying is,

122
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:47,240
I want every dollar we make from now on

123
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:49,600
to be clean.

124
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:51,559
Otherwise,

125
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:53,879
we'll end up like Dongshan Tai.

126
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,159
We make the money,

127
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:57,679
but don't live long enough to spend it.

128
00:08:58,159 --> 00:08:58,840
Can you pull it off?

129
00:08:59,679 --> 00:09:01,080
As long as you elders trust me,

130
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,360
I can.

131
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,080
Sir.

132
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,120
Enjoy your meal.

133
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:54,120
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant
12:20)

134
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:05,700
(Demolition)

135
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,200
What's his name?

136
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:09,720
Wangcai.

137
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:54,440
(Shicheng Royal Police Intake Form)

138
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:16,679
Boss Che.

139
00:13:17,919 --> 00:13:18,480
It's me.

140
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,159
You know everything now.

141
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,120
That day, my brother

142
00:13:36,919 --> 00:13:38,399
went to give you your wallet.

143
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:42,679
That's how he saw you with Luo Song.

144
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:47,680
(Menu, Sold Out)

145
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,559
My brother didn't know
what undercover meant.

146
00:13:50,519 --> 00:13:51,720
He didn't know what
a covert meeting was.

147
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,320
All he knew

148
00:13:56,279 --> 00:13:57,440
was that you were in danger.

149
00:13:57,759 --> 00:13:59,080
He wanted to save you.

150
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:04,679
That's why he ran into the road
and got hit by a car.

151
00:14:08,039 --> 00:14:08,840
You...

152
00:14:12,799 --> 00:14:14,759
You got my brother killed.

153
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:17,399
Five years.

154
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,600
For five years, I treated you
like a brother.

155
00:14:21,799 --> 00:14:23,159
I thought besides my brother,

156
00:14:23,759 --> 00:14:25,080
you were the only person

157
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:25,960
I had left in this world.

158
00:14:27,919 --> 00:14:28,600
And what did I get?

159
00:14:31,600 --> 00:14:32,799
You traded our lives

160
00:14:33,759 --> 00:14:35,159
for your glory.

161
00:14:38,799 --> 00:14:40,919
You even lied to me about your birthday.

162
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:42,960
When's your birthday?

163
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:45,639
Today.

164
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:49,120
Then let's celebrate together.

165
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:50,800
(Shicheng Royal Police Intake Form
Date of Birth: May 3, 1973)

166
00:14:57,799 --> 00:14:58,799
I'm a cop.

167
00:15:00,799 --> 00:15:01,840
I have a job to do.

168
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,519
I have principles I have to stand by.

169
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:08,759
But Lin...

170
00:15:13,919 --> 00:15:15,559
what I felt for you and Fu was real.

171
00:15:17,399 --> 00:15:18,240
I don't know how

172
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,200
things ended up like this, but...

173
00:15:21,879 --> 00:15:23,279
I know saying sorry won't
change anything.

174
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:26,080
I'm sorry.

175
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:28,799
A cop.

176
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,399
You have your job to do.

177
00:15:32,320 --> 00:15:33,480
You have your precious principles.

178
00:15:35,679 --> 00:15:37,080
But you got my brother killed.

179
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,759
There's blood on your hands now.

180
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,559
So how are you any different from us?

181
00:15:41,799 --> 00:15:43,200
After Fu died,

182
00:15:44,279 --> 00:15:45,879
you already knew who I was.

183
00:15:50,919 --> 00:15:52,799
So everything after that

184
00:15:54,919 --> 00:15:56,039
was all part of your plan.

185
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,799
Stop!

186
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:58,799
Stop!

187
00:15:59,279 --> 00:15:59,759
Boss Lin.

188
00:16:00,559 --> 00:16:01,320
We spotted Fei Liu.

189
00:16:01,879 --> 00:16:03,080
Dongshan Tai's men are after him.

190
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:03,919
Go check it out.

191
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,159
Boss Liu.

192
00:16:07,159 --> 00:16:08,360
How'd you end up like this?

193
00:16:09,559 --> 00:16:10,600
Shen Yanlin.

194
00:16:11,559 --> 00:16:12,320
You called the police?

195
00:16:12,559 --> 00:16:13,480
That's right, Officer Luo.

196
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:14,919
I called the police.

197
00:16:14,919 --> 00:16:15,600
I called the police.

198
00:16:16,159 --> 00:16:16,919
Me included.

199
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:23,440
Yeah.

200
00:16:25,399 --> 00:16:26,519
I did use you

201
00:16:28,559 --> 00:16:29,960
to bring Dongshan Tai down.

202
00:16:32,639 --> 00:16:33,240
Boss Che.

203
00:16:34,159 --> 00:16:35,360
I learned it from you.

204
00:16:36,399 --> 00:16:37,919
Betraying your own brother.

205
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:50,279
Lin.

206
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,600
You killed Fei Liu.

207
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:21,279
You cops need evidence

208
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,000
before you make accusations.
